The  driver  supports  PCI SCSI host adapters based on the Initio
INIC‐940 and INIC‐950 chips.  The  INI‐9090U,  INI‐9100U/UW,  the
Iwill  2935UW  and the IOI Technology IOI‐4203U have been tested.
The driver was originally written for by Kenneth  R.  Westerback,
based on a driver by Winston Hung.  Izumi Tsutsui ported the dri‐
ver to driver does not currently use tagged command queuing.
